        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_8e001ed_1513937093590_846585_60511"/>
        <body>A MessageRelationship is a link between two related messages. The meaning of the association depends on MessageRelationship.RelationType. &lt;example&gt;If Id=2 replaces Id=1, then MessageRelationship.Related points to Id=2 and MessageRelationship.Relating points to Id=1 with MessageRelationship.RelationType="replaces".&lt;/example&gt;</body>
      </ownedComment>
      <name>MessageRelationship</name>
      <generalization xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1721221107517_71671_148820" xmi:uuid="75ff08f9-3e25-4810-8b45-c8164ca4639f" xmi:type="uml:Generalization">
