          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_8e001ed_1513937131251_757656_60554"/>
          <body>the identifier or set of identifiers for the MessageRelationship. The value of this attribute need not be specified. &lt;note&gt;This attribute supports multi-identification in different contexts as described in Fundamental concepts and assumptions.&lt;/note&gt; </body>
        </ownedComment>
